{"c":{"214581":["Beatrix Amerhauser","Female","b214581-lk2deJ8pNsae.png","She came all the way to Japan from Germany because she loves Japanese culture. She saved up money to visit but the apocalypse had already started once she arrived at the airport.",685],"214582":["Shizuka Mikazuki","Female","b214582-k5Bcd0DB59ik.jpg","Shizuka Mikazuki is a very rational girl who prefers to act alone. Her actions are determined by the benefits and risk of said situation. This is the main reason why she didn't join up with Akira and Kenichirou at first. Her personality is because of her upbringing.",1506],"214583":["Kenichirou Ryuuzaki","Male","b214583-akJm3W589tEd.png","An old friend of Akira Tendou from college and the rugby team. He hasn't seen him in a year before the apocalypse. After he graduated from college he became a salesmen at a major real estate company because of his great communication skills.",521],"214584":["Akira Tendou","Male","b214584-4zsaqbOP55bf.png","Akira Tendou is a former employee of a company that earned the nickname Black Company (exploitative employment system). This job made Akira so miserable that he was excited that there was a zombie apocalypse because he didn't have to go to work.",1023],"214585":["Naoki Atenbou","Male","b214585-tqGRD7gHrZ4h.png","He is a former apprentice chef that was a part of Kanta Higurashi's group.",1],"214586":["Kanta Higurashi","Male","b214586-UHkFPhvnrdid.png","He is a former NEET and the leader of his group, consisting of people he found during the apocalypse's first days.",42],"214587":["Touko Kanbayashi","Female","b214587-XrfD16IF9BaD.png","She is a former municipal office worker that was a part of Kanta Higurashi's group.",6],"214588":["Mikio Kousaka","Male","b214588-GttxgerRTW0I.png","He is a former airline pilot that lives neighbouring Akira, along with his wife Sumire Kousaka.",6],"214589":["Sumire Kousaka","Female","b214589-JfeIFeDYuMaU.png","She is a former violin instructor that lives neighbouring Akira, along 